        "node_id": "n_7_6f6e77",
        "thought_text": "Model the problem as a shortest path search on a graph where nodes are permutations and edges are allowed swaps, using Breadth-First Search (BFS) to find the minimum number of swaps since all edge weights are 1.",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "-4088912705885270242",
